OL,3,AFlydubai co-pilot attacked captain with
OL,4,Aaxe, UAE official says
OL,5,
OL,6,FCapt Smit Machchhar said he was lying
OL,7,Fon the floor injured when he realised
OL,8,Fthe plane was sinking and he had to
OL,9,Fact, explaining: "I told myself to go
OL,10,Ffor one last push to open the door from
OL,11,Finside", which allowed the passengers
OL,12,Fin.
OL,14,FTwo reserve pilots then landed the
OL,15,Fplane safely in Saudi Arabia.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
